          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bridge is in use by another phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bridge is not in pairing mode. Tap \"Pair with iPhone\" in the InsightBridge app and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Bridge ist nicht im Kopplungsmodus. Tippe in der InsightBridge-App auf „Mit iPhone koppeln“ und versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bridge is not in pairing mode. Tap \"Pair with iPhone\" in the InsightBridge app and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bridge rejected the pairing data. Something may be interfering; try again close to the bridge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Bridge hat die Kopplungsdaten abgelehnt. Möglicherweise stört etwas; versuche es erneut in der Nähe der Bridge."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bridge rejected the pairing data. Something may be interfering; try again close to the bridge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bridge reported an error.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Bridge hat einen Fehler gemeldet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bridge reported an error."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection to the InsightBridge app was lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung zur InsightBridge-App wurde unterbrochen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection to the InsightBridge app was lost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection was interrupted while Trio was sending %@. Trio does not know whether the pump carried it out and will never send it again by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung wurde unterbrochen, als Trio %@ gesendet hat. Trio weiß nicht, ob die Pumpe den Befehl ausgeführt hat, und sendet ihn niemals von selbst erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection was interrupted while Trio was sending %@. Trio does not know whether the pump carried it out and will never send it again by itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The insulin cartridge is running low. Prepare a new cartridge.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Insulinpatrone ist fast leer. Halte eine neue Patrone bereit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The insulin cartridge is running low. Prepare a new cartridge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pump asks for maintenance. Check the pump display.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Pumpe verlangt eine Wartung. Prüfe das Pumpendisplay."
